  • Coordination reduces redundant search by 4-5×

6.5 BELIEF FUSION ANALYSIS
--------------------------

Belief fusion strategies compared:
  • Consensus fusion: Continuous sharing with weighted averaging
  • Periodic sync: Full synchronization every 10 steps
  • No fusion: Agents maintain independent beliefs

Key findings:
  • Consensus-based fusion reduces entropy 35% faster than periodic sync
  • Consensus reduces entropy 60% faster than no fusion
  • With consensus fusion, average KL divergence drops below 0.1 within 20 steps

