  • At 70% message loss, gap widens to 85% vs 70%

6.7 COMMUNICATION RANGE EFFECTS
-------------------------------

  • Full connectivity (50m+): SPL = 0.75
  • 30m range (partial): SPL = 0.71 (95% of full)
  • 20m range: SPL = 0.67 (89% of full)
  • 10m range (minimal): SPL = 0.59 (79% of full)

SEEK-Multi provides significant benefits even with limited communication range.

