  • Operations wing: Control room, 4 monitoring stations, equipment room
  • Warehouse: 6 storage areas, loading dock, maintenance shop
  • Labs: 4 research labs, 2 clean rooms, equipment storage
  • Common: Cafeteria, 4 restrooms, 4 hallways, 2 stairwells, utility rooms
  • Total area: ~2000 m²
  • Average room size: 42 m²

