C.3 SENSOR MODEL DETAILS
------------------------

  • Field of view: 90° horizontal, 60° vertical
  • Detection range: 5m nominal, 10m for thorough search
  • True positive rate: 0.9 (varies with distance)
  • False positive rate: 0.05 per observation
  • Position noise: Gaussian with σ = 0.5m
  • Classification accuracy: 0.95 for target object class

Detection probability decreases with distance:

    p_det(d) = p_tp · exp(-(d - d_opt)² / 2σ_d²)

where d_opt = 3m is the optimal detection distance.


